      {
        "t": "Kuru gives us a real on-chain order book, so the wall is real liquidity, not a mock.",
        "start": 5.22,
        "end": 9.88
      },
      {
        "t": "And Pyth Entropy gives us a fair end that nobody, not even us, can know in advance.",
        "start": 10.1,
